        "name": "Injection",
        "score": 9,
        "rationale": "The term is only ever passed as a bound `?` parameter with `%`, `_` and `\\` escaped under an explicit ESCAPE clause, so nothing reaches the statement text; the only deviation is that the surrounding wildcards are concatenated in SQL (`'%' || ? || '%'`) rather than placed in the bound value, which is equally safe."
